    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49414" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύμος</span></b>  [perh. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ</span>] (B), ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>warty excrescence</i>, <i><span class="en">
